    "whyMatters": "The abstracted lemma is a reusable Galois-theory fact about transitive subgroups of S_p with a unique Sylow p-subgroup, potentially contributable to Mathlib alongside the classical result that a transitive subgroup of S_p containing a transposition is all of S_p."
